{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1507163-chronicles-of-darkness-style-guide-an-update","id":1507163,"title":"Chronicles of Darkness Style Guide, an update?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-04-02T00:26:50-07:00","id":1507163,"title":"Chronicles of Darkness Style Guide, an update?","content":"I am aware of the current conditions for OPP regarding the publication of CofD materials, so this is a question to test the waters.<br /> <br /> In 2019 we received a collection style guides for CofD, the <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/258968/Chronicles-of-Darkness-Storytellers-Vault-Style-Guide?affiliate_id=321987\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Storytellers Vault Style Guide</a></b>. Since then <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/347148/Mummy-The-Curse-Second-Edition?affiliate_id=321987\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy the Curse</a></b> and <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/369633/Hunter-The-Vigil-Second-Edition?affiliate_id=321987\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter the Vigil</a></b> have received their second editions, and <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/341534/Deviant-The-Renegades?affiliate_id=321987\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant the Renegades</a></b> has been published. Would there be an opportunity for OPP publishing updated style guides for these?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27293-cabaal","name":"Cabaal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27293_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T13:43:26-07:00","id":1507206,"title":"","conten